<title>JAPAN: Keiyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Keiyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 73.68		vs	   71.23</p>
<p> Operating	    2.05		vs	    1.81</p>
<p> Current		2.26		vs	    2.11</p>
<p> Net		    1.33		vs	    1.02</p>
<p> EPS		   22.34 yen	  vs	   17.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     59 million	  vs	  59 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.25 yen	  vs	    6.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keiyo Co Ltd is a chain store operator handling household goods and sporting products.</p>
